logs: add --follow to stream new lines

`devkit logs --follow` keeps printing lines as the service appends them,
reusing the existing pipeFile streaming helper. --follow rejects --grep:
pipe the stream to grep instead.

Also adds `devkit symbols <trace> <map>` to symbolicate production stack
traces locally while I was in here, and parseInterval for the polling
interval option that lands next.

